    "preamble": "Ramkisan S/O Patram Bishnoi vs State Of Mah., Thr. Pso Wadi P S Dist ... on 8 July, 2019 Author: P.N. Deshmukh Bench: P.N. Deshmukh 1/2 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Nagpur Bench, Nagpur. Criminal Application (Apl) No. 661/2019. (Ramkisan Patram Bishnoi, Nagpur & Anr. Vs. State of Maharashtra, thr. Pso, Wadi Polic Station, Nagpur & Anr.) ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Office notes, Office Memoranda of Coram, appearances, Court's orders Court's or Judge' or directions and Registrar's orders. ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Mr. S.A.Mohta, Advocate for applicants. Mr. M.K.Pathan, Additional Public Prosecutor for respondents/State. Coram : P.N.Deshmukh & Mrs. Pushpa V. Ganediwala, Jj. Date : 08.07.2019. Heard.",
    "facts": "1 (i) The learned APP on instructions of Shri Kiran R. Gedam, Food Safety Officer, Nagpur submits that in terms of provisions of Section 38(1)(c) proviso of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, necessary bond with an undertaking would be taken from the applicants herein.",
